### OrderFlow — fluxo completo de demonstração
### Compatível com o HTTP Client do IntelliJ IDEA.
### Altere a porta se APP_PORT estiver diferente de 8080.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@adminEmail = admin@orderflow.local
@adminPassword = LocalAdmin123!
@idempotencyKey = demo-order-001

### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
X-Correlation-Id: demo-health

### 2. Registrar um cliente novo e guardar o JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-register

{
  "name": "Cliente Demonstração",
  "email": "cliente-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 3. Autenticar o administrador local e guardar o JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-admin-login

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 4. Consultar o usuário autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-current-user

### 5. Criar categoria como administrador
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-create-category

{
  "name": "Categoria Demo {{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "Categoria criada pelo fluxo de demonstração"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id);
%}

### 6. Criar produto com estoque
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-create-product

{
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "name": "Teclado de demonstração",
  "sku": "DEMO-{{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "Produto usado no fluxo completo",
  "price": 149.90,
  "stock": 10
}

> {%
    client.global.set("productId", response.body.id);
%}

### 7. Buscar produtos pelo filtro de categoria
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId={{categoryId}}&size=20
X-Correlation-Id: demo-search-product

### 8. Criar pedido — primeira tentativa retorna 201
### Troque @idempotencyKey antes de iniciar outro pedido com payload diferente.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-create-order

{
  "shippingAddress": "Rua da Demonstração, 100",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": {{productId}},
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id);
%}

### 9. Repetir exatamente o pedido — retorna 200 e o mesmo corpo
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-replay-order

{
  "shippingAddress": "Rua da Demonstração, 100",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": {{productId}},
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 10. Criar e processar pagamento PIX
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-create-payment

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "method": "PIX"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("paymentId", response.body.id);
%}

### 11. Consultar pagamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-get-payment

### 12. Enviar pedido como administrador
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-ship-order

### 13. Entregar pedido como administrador
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-deliver-order

### 14. Consultar pedido entregue
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-final-order

### 15. Confirmar que o estoque caiu de 10 para 8
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-final-stock
